1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
New tires but your steering wheel

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,000
sits crooked?

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,500
That's not a bad tire —

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
it's the wheel that's off, not the tread.

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,800
One clue: the alignment was already off —

6
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:15,000
new tread just made it easier to notice.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Left off-center, that pull can wear

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
brand-new tread unevenly.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,500
Don't guess. An alignment check

10
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
can find what's actually off.

11
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Worth checking before new tread wears down crooked.

12
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Stop by and we'll take a look — Nick's Tire & Auto.
